    D --> Q
    Q --> W
    M -.-> Q
  end
  subgraph IV["4 · Investigation / review"]
    direction TB
    PM["Operator-owned pinned manifest<br/>Immutable reference + content hash"]
    K["Immutable actual case / revision<br/>Subject · credential · count · source witness"]
    I["Real Guild-hosted investigator<br/>Read exact pinned context; create owned-repo issue"]
